# Web3Forms access key — get one free at https://web3forms.com
#
# Public by design: this value is embedded in the built HTML. It only permits
# POSTing to the inbox it is bound to, so it is not a secret.
#
# When unset, both contact forms render with the submit button disabled and
# show a fallback notice pointing at the phone number and email instead.
#
# Copy this file to .env (already gitignored) and paste the real key below.
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
